{"parentUuid":"d4000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000017","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"PROJECT_CWD","sessionId":"SESSION_ID","version":"2.1.229","gitBranch":"main","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Paths in an @include are relative to the file that contains the directive, not to the cwd. The releasekit-agent runs the parser from / and the configs live under /etc/releasekit/conf.d, so `@include inc.conf` inside /etc/releasekit/conf.d/main.conf must mean /etc/releasekit/conf.d/inc.conf. That is RB-655. Yours resolves against the cwd."},"uuid":"d4000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000018","timestamp":"2026-08-24T11:21:43.000Z"}
